# Local Vite: leave empty and let vite.config.ts proxy /api → http://localhost:8080
# Docker web / nginx: /api
# Direct to gateway (needs CORS): http://localhost:8080
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Optional Google Maps Embed API key. Leave empty to use the public embed/share URL.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Cloudflare Pages Functions:
# - Catalog reads: D1
# - Contact form: Resend (RESEND_API_KEY, CONTACT_TO_EMAIL, CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL)
# - Other write APIs (quotes, etc.): RAILWAY_API_BASE_URL
# Set these in the Cloudflare dashboard or in `.dev.vars` for `wrangler pages dev`.
# See `.dev.vars.example`.
